      "writtenOn": "2014-03-04T23:00:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We should handle GPIO_SUSPEND_L in the power module.\n\nAt chipset startup (near where we set ap_on \u003d 1), gpio_set_flags() to add pull-up, then enable interrupt.\n\nAt chipset shutdown (where we set ap_on \u003d 0), disable interrupt, then remove pull-up.\n\nThis will save power whenever the chipset is shut down, even without hibernate.  And it will prevent interrupts from firing when the line is floating.",
      "revId": "14de4492c9bc102d3af8f111a6bf577e4fd68248",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
